<p><span class="">Add the necessary activities from the Add activity or resource-button when editing is turned on from the managing tools.</span></p></div>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:11;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"11";s:7:"section";s:1:"2";s:4:"name";s:17:"Content/Materials";s:7:"summary";s:613:"<div style="color:#d20c0c;"><p><span class=""></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><b><span class=""><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/undraw_youtube_tutorial_2gn3.png" alt="content" width="349" height="253" class="img-responsive atto_image_button_middle"><br></span></b></p><p><b><span class="">Give a short description of the content and the materials.</span></b></p><div><p>Add the necessary activities from the Add acticity or resource-button when editing is turned on from the managing tools. NB! Check out and make use of the various templates that can be found in Teacher's Toolbox section.<br></p></div></div>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:12;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"12";s:7:"section";s:1:"3";s:4:"name";s:10:"Recap/Quiz";s:7:"summary";s:517:"<p><span style="font-size: 1rem;" class=""></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><b><span class=""><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/undraw_Questions_re_1fy7.png" alt="quiz" width="300" height="209" class="img-responsive atto_image_button_text-bottom"><br></span></b></p><p><b><span class="">Describe in short the requirements of taking and passing the quiz.</span></b></p><div><p>Add the necessary activities from the Add activity or resource-button when editing is turned on from the managing tools.<br></p></div><p></p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:13;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"13";s:7:"section";s:1:"4";s:4:"name";s:20:"Certificate/Feedback";s:7:"summary";s:791:"<p style="text-align: center;"><b><span class=""><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/undraw_certificate_343v.png" alt="Document" width="300" height="222" class="img-responsive atto_image_button_middle"></span></b></p><p style="text-align: left;"><b><span class="">Here you can congratulate the student on finishing the course and for being granted the certificate. If the course needs to be renewed after a time period, mention it here.&nbsp;</span></b></p><p><span><span class="" style=""><b>If you have a system for collecting feedback, you can insert the link here.</b><br></span></span></p><p><b><span class="">Access to this section is restricted until the criteria for access is met. In this case the quiz needs to be passed before getting access to the certificate.</span></b><br></p><p><br></p>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:14;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"14";s:7:"section";s:1:"5";s:4:"name";s:17:"Teacher's toolbox";s:7:"summary";s:158:"<h3 style="text-align: left;"><b><em>This section includes instructions and materials visible only to teachers and managers on the course.&nbsp;</em></b></h3>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}i:15;O:8:"stdClass":7:{s:2:"id";s:2:"15";s:7:"section";s:1:"6";s:4:"name";s:7:"Credits";s:7:"summary";s:475:"Template created in <a href="https://www.digivet4all.com" target="_blank">Digital Vocational Education for All (DigiVET4ALL) project</a>. Co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union.<br><br><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/DigiVET4ALLlogo.jpg" alt="DigiVET4ALL project logo" width="300" height="161" class="img-responsive atto_image_button_left"><img src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/Logo%20banner.PNG" alt="Logo Banner" width="1200" height="117" class="atto_image_button_left"><br>";s:12:"availability";s:28:"{"op":"&","c":[],"showc":[]}";s:9:"component";N;s:6:"itemid";N;}}s:9:"shortname";s:51:"DigiVET - Generic course template, Collapsed topics";s:8:"fullname";s:51:"DigiVET - Generic course template, Collapsed topics";s:6: